---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from './PageHeader.astro';
import Callout from './Callout.astro';
import CodeBlock from './CodeBlock.astro';

interface Props { lang: 'en' | 'id' }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const id = lang === 'id';

const internalDefaults = [
  ['HTTP', '0.0.0.0:3000', id ? 'Alamat aplikasi di dalam container.' : 'Application address inside the container.'],
  ['Host publish', '127.0.0.1:3000', id ? 'Compose publish hanya ke loopback host.' : 'Compose publishes only to host loopback.'],
  ['Data', '/app/data', id ? 'Root persistent volume; production menolak storage ephemeral.' : 'Persistent volume root; production rejects ephemeral storage.'],
  ['Database', '/app/data/wago.db', id ? 'SQLite durable state dan webhook outbox.' : 'SQLite durable state and webhook outbox.'],
  ['WhatsApp auth', '/app/data/auth', id ? 'Baileys multi-file auth state.' : 'Baileys multi-file auth state.'],
  ['Active instance', '1', id ? 'Satu owner untuk satu persistent volume/account.' : 'One owner for one persistent volume/account.'],
  ['Browser session', '30 days', id ? 'Opaque HttpOnly cookie; hash saja di SQLite.' : 'Opaque HttpOnly cookie; hash only in SQLite.'],
  ['Request body', '32kb', id ? 'Batas JSON body.' : 'JSON body limit.'],
  ['Local phone prefix', '62', id ? 'Default internal untuk nomor lokal yang diawali 0.' : 'Internal default for local numbers beginning with 0.'],
  ['Forwarded client identity', 'not trusted', id ? 'Wago tidak mempercayai forwarded client IP/header melalui konfigurasi operator.' : 'Wago does not trust forwarded client IP/header identity through operator configuration.'],
  ['Webhook timeout', '5s', id ? 'Timeout tiap HTTP callback attempt.' : 'Timeout for each callback HTTP attempt.'],
  ['Webhook retry horizon', '24h', id ? 'At-least-once durable retry; incoming payload hanya dapat bertahan selama window aktif ini.' : 'At-least-once durable retry; incoming payload can exist only during this active window.'],
  ['Webhook test', '5/min', id ? 'Dashboard-only test callback rate limit.' : 'Dashboard-only test callback rate limit.'],
];
---

<DocsLayout title={id ? 'Konfigurasi' : 'Configuration'}>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Runtime configuration"
    title={id ? 'Setup zero-env' : 'Zero-env setup'}
    description={id ? 'Wago tidak memiliki environment variable sebagai product configuration surface. Admin password, machine API key, recipient policy, dan webhook dikelola dari workflow Wago dan durable state.' : 'Wago does not use environment variables as a product configuration surface. Admin password, machine API key, recipient policy, and webhooks are managed through Wago workflows and durable state.'}
  />

  <Callout title={id ? 'API key bukan password dashboard' : 'The API key is not the dashboard password'} tone="warning">
    {id ? 'Operator manusia membuat dan memakai admin password melalui dashboard. Pairing juga memakai browser session dashboard. External service memakai Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY> hanya jika integrasi REST diperlukan.' : 'Human operators create and use an admin password through the dashboard. Pairing also uses the dashboard browser session. External services use Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY> only when REST integration is needed.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'Deployment zero-env' : 'Zero-env deployment'}</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`docker compose pull\ndocker compose up -d`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Pada fresh instance, Wago menampilkan onboarding sebelum workspace utama. Masukkan admin password minimum 12 byte. Wago membuat salted scrypt hash di SQLite, tidak menyimpan raw password, lalu membuat HttpOnly browser session.' : 'On a fresh instance, Wago shows onboarding before the main workspace. Enter an admin password of at least 12 bytes. Wago writes a salted scrypt hash to SQLite, never stores the raw password, then creates an HttpOnly browser session.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] mb-4">{id ? 'Klik Pair WhatsApp langsung setelah onboarding. Pairing memakai browser session dan tidak membuat machine API key. Jika external application memerlukan REST API, klik Generate API key di Gateway access; raw key ditampilkan sekali dan server menyimpan hanya SHA-256 hash.' : 'Click Pair WhatsApp directly after onboarding. Pairing uses the browser session and does not create a machine API key. If an external application needs the REST API, click Generate API key in Gateway access; the raw key is shown once and the server stores only its SHA-256 hash.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Tidak ada override environment' : 'No environment overrides'}>
    {id ? 'Wago tidak menyediakan API-key deployment override, Vite API-base override, country-code env, proxy-trust env, atau .env example. Konfigurasi operator yang nyata harus hidup di dashboard/persisted state, bukan precedence tersembunyi yang memerlukan restart.' : 'Wago does not provide deployment API-key overrides, Vite API-base overrides, country-code envs, proxy-trust envs, or an .env example. Real operator configuration belongs in the dashboard/persisted state rather than hidden restart-based precedence.'}
  </Callout>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Fresh instance adalah first-browser ownership' : 'Fresh instances use first-browser ownership'} tone="warning">{id ? 'Selesaikan onboarding admin sebelum dashboard yang belum ter-setup dapat dijangkau jaringan tidak terpercaya. Same-origin mencegah cross-site claim, tetapi tidak membedakan dua pengguna yang sama-sama dapat membuka origin fresh Wago.' : 'Complete admin onboarding before an uninitialized dashboard is reachable from an untrusted network. Same-origin validation prevents cross-site claiming, but it cannot distinguish two users who can both directly reach a fresh Wago origin.'}</Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">Browser sessions & API-key rotation</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Dashboard memverifikasi admin password terhadap salted hash di SQLite lalu mengeluarkan opaque HttpOnly browser session. Session ini mengotorisasi pairing dan operasi dashboard bahkan bila machine API key belum dibuat. Rotasi generated machine API key mencabut semua browser session lain tetapi mempertahankan browser yang melakukan rotasi agar operator dapat menyimpan key baru. WhatsApp auth tidak berubah.' : 'The dashboard verifies the admin password against the salted hash in SQLite and issues an opaque HttpOnly browser session. This session authorizes pairing and dashboard operations even when no machine API key exists. Rotating a generated machine API key revokes every other browser session while preserving the browser performing the rotation so the operator can save the new key. WhatsApp auth is unchanged.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] mb-8">{id ? 'Raw admin password tidak dipersistenkan. Raw generated API key juga tidak dipersistenkan; hanya hash yang disimpan setelah key ditampilkan sekali.' : 'The raw admin password is not persisted. The raw generated API key is also not persisted; only its hash remains after the key is shown once.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">Webhook events</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Konfigurasi dilakukan dari Settings → Webhook integration. Wago menyimpan callback URL dan raw signing secret di private SQLite state karena nilai secret asli diperlukan untuk HMAC.' : 'Configuration is managed from Settings → Webhook integration. Wago stores the callback URL and raw signing secret in private SQLite state because the original secret is required for HMAC.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Event production yang didukung adalah message.received untuk text masuk direct/private chat; message.server_accepted, message.delivered, message.read, dan message.played untuk evidence lifecycle outbound; serta message.rejected untuk rejection outbound. wago.test dipakai untuk verifikasi konfigurasi.' : 'Supported production events are message.received for live direct/private incoming text; message.server_accepted, message.delivered, message.read, and message.played for outbound lifecycle evidence; and message.rejected for outbound rejection. wago.test is used for configuration verification.'}</p>
  <CodeBlock label="message.received" code={`{
  "version": "1",
  "id": "<webhook-delivery-id>",
  "event": "message.received",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-02T00:00:01.000Z",
  "data": {
    "messageId": "in_<stable-wago-id>",
    "from": "6281234567890",
    "text": "hello",
    "receivedAt": "2026-09-02T00:00:00.000Z"
  }
}`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'message.received hanya berasal dari live Baileys notify event. Echo fromMe, history append, group, status/broadcast/newsletter, dan non-text tidak menghasilkan event pada milestone ini. messageId Wago stabil sehingga duplicate provider notification tidak membuat logical webhook event kedua.' : 'message.received is emitted only from live Baileys notify events. fromMe echoes, history append, groups, status/broadcast/newsletter traffic, and non-text content do not emit an event in this milestone. The Wago messageId is stable so duplicate provider notifications do not create a second logical webhook event.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Incoming sender/text bukan chat history. Nilai ini hanya dipersistenkan di retry payload selama delivery masih pending/delivering, maksimum 24 jam. Ketika delivery menjadi delivered, failed, atau expired, SQLite meredaksi payload secara atomik; metadata delivery dan attempt history tetap tersedia tanpa sender/text. Karena payload sudah hilang, terminal message.received tidak dapat di-manual-redeliver.' : 'Incoming sender/text is not chat history. It is persisted only inside the retry payload while the delivery remains pending/delivering, for at most 24 hours. When the delivery becomes delivered, failed, or expired, SQLite atomically redacts the payload; delivery metadata and attempt history remain without sender/text. Because the payload is gone, terminal message.received deliveries cannot be manually redelivered.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Setelah konfigurasi enabled disimpan, Send test webhook membuat event wago.test tanpa message/recipient data. Test memakai signing, timeout, durable queue, retry, dan delivery history production yang sama sehingga hasilnya memverifikasi jalur callback sebenarnya.' : 'After an enabled configuration is saved, Send test webhook creates a wago.test event without message or recipient data. The test uses the same production signing, timeout, durable queue, retry, and delivery history so the result verifies the real callback path.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Test webhook hanya tersedia untuk browser session dashboard, memakai same-origin guard di production, dan dibatasi 5 request per menit. Bearer API key tidak dapat memanggil test endpoint.' : 'Webhook tests are available only to authenticated dashboard browser sessions, enforce same-origin in production, and are limited to 5 requests per minute. Bearer API keys cannot call the test endpoint.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Callback membawa Webhook-Id, Webhook-Timestamp, Webhook-Signature, X-Wago-Event, dan X-Wago-Delivery. Consumer harus verifikasi HMAC pada raw body, batasi umur timestamp, lalu deduplicate dengan Webhook-Id. Untuk business-level incoming-message dedupe, gunakan data.messageId.' : 'Callbacks include Webhook-Id, Webhook-Timestamp, Webhook-Signature, X-Wago-Event, and X-Wago-Delivery. Consumers must verify HMAC against the raw body, enforce timestamp age, then deduplicate by Webhook-Id. For business-level incoming-message dedupe, use data.messageId.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Delivery bersifat at-least-once. Timeout/network/408/429/5xx diretry durably sampai 24 jam. Retry mempertahankan delivery ID yang sama; manual redelivery juga mempertahankan ID untuk event yang payload-nya masih tersedia.' : 'Delivery is at least once. Timeout/network/408/429/5xx failures are retried durably for up to 24 hours. Retries preserve the same delivery ID; manual redelivery also preserves it for events whose payload is still available.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Delivery evidence bersifat observasional' : 'Delivery evidence is observational'} tone="warning">{id ? 'message.server_accepted berarti WhatsApp memberikan server acknowledgement. message.delivered, message.read, dan message.played hanya diterbitkan jika Baileys/WhatsApp mengekspos evidence tersebut. Read/played tidak dijamin tersedia dan tidak mengubah contract operation state pending/accepted/rejected.' : 'message.server_accepted means WhatsApp produced a server acknowledgement. message.delivered, message.read, and message.played are emitted only when Baileys/WhatsApp exposes that evidence. Read/played are not guaranteed and do not change the pending/accepted/rejected operation-state contract.'}</Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'Origin dan browser security' : 'Origin and browser security'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Wago tidak memiliki operator CORS allowlist. Production admin setup, dashboard sign-in, dan explicit machine API-key generation memerlukan same-origin. State-changing request dengan cookie auth menolak mismatched Origin.' : 'Wago does not expose an operator CORS allowlist. Production admin setup, dashboard sign-in, and explicit machine API-key generation require same-origin. State-changing cookie-authenticated requests reject a mismatched Origin.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'External integration tetap server-to-server' : 'External integrations remain server-to-server'}>{id ? 'Jangan tanam admin password, Bearer API key, atau webhook signing secret pada public browser bundle.' : 'Do not embed the admin password, Bearer API keys, or webhook signing secrets in a public browser bundle.'}</Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-4">{id ? 'Default internal' : 'Internal defaults'}</h2>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-sm text-left"><thead><tr class="border-b border-[#262626] text-[#71717a]"><th class="py-2.5 pr-4">Setting</th><th class="py-2.5 pr-4">Default</th><th class="py-2.5">{id ? 'Keterangan' : 'Description'}</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-[#1a1a1a] text-[#a1a1aa]">{internalDefaults.map(row => <tr><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#fafafa]">{row[0]}</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#71717a]"><code>{row[1]}</code></td><td class="py-3">{row[2]}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">Outbound limits</h2>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] space-y-2 mb-4"><li>{id ? 'Account: 30 accepted send / 60 detik.' : 'Account: 30 accepted sends / 60 seconds.'}</li><li>{id ? 'Recipient: 5 accepted send / 60 detik.' : 'Recipient: 5 accepted sends / 60 seconds.'}</li><li>{id ? 'New chat: 10 recipient baru / jam.' : 'New chat: 10 new recipients / hour.'}</li><li>{id ? 'Webhook test: 5 request / menit untuk dashboard session.' : 'Webhook test: 5 requests/minute for dashboard sessions.'}</li><li>{id ? 'Manual webhook redelivery: 20 request / menit per source IP.' : 'Manual webhook redelivery: 20 requests/minute per source IP.'}</li></ul>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Selain guardrail lokal, Wago mengonsumsi signal new-chat capping dari WhatsApp. FIRST_WARNING/SECOND_WARNING ditampilkan sebagai pressure signal tetapi tidak memblokir send. Hanya CAPPED yang memblokir new-recipient outbound; recipient yang sudah dikenal tetap dievaluasi melalui policy normal.' : 'In addition to local guardrails, Wago consumes WhatsApp new-chat capping signals. FIRST_WARNING/SECOND_WARNING are surfaced as pressure signals without blocking sends. Only CAPPED blocks new-recipient outbound; known recipients continue through the normal policy path.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Guardrail lokal' : 'Local guardrails'} tone="warning">{id ? 'Angka tersebut adalah default defensif Wago, bukan threshold resmi WhatsApp atau jaminan anti-ban.' : 'These values are Wago defensive defaults, not official WhatsApp thresholds or an anti-ban guarantee.'}</Callout>
</DocsLayout>